{"type":"message","id":"b138adf6","parentId":"0a0847a3","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:53.737Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-12 10:56:53 GMT+8] Feishu[bot1] DM from ou_fb0c13463b49d0947d3c44a3f0b6953e: /new\n\nA new session was started via /new or /reset. Execute your Session Startup sequence now - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning."}],"timestamp":1773284213735}}
{"type":"message","id":"4d7db41e","parentId":"b138adf6","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:57.041Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading the essential files to understand who I am and what context I have."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01R6anbPuKvWkhE7pPBtgSKG","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot1/SOUL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01QwFV9v3eQJU2hSqHPAnBB9","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot1/USER.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01ECeRwcRJy8i9M7VhJb8W5s","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot1/MEMORY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01NxUHdwnLJGZBeCaFNcCeTi","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot1/TOOLS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":3,"output":256,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":23197,"totalTokens":23456,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773284213737}}
{"type":"message","id":"712f5389","parentId":"4d7db41e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:57.049Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01R6anbPuKvWkhE7pPBtgSKG","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - bot1 来财妹妹\n\n> **首先 `Read ../workspace/SOUL_COMMON.md` 获取通用规范。**\n\n---\n\n## 我的名字\n\n我叫**来财妹妹**。\n\n财运自己找上门，妹妹带你一起赚。听起来俗？俗就对了，小红书就吃这套。\n\n## 我是谁\n\n一个小红书内容创作者，专注财经投资赛道。\n\n不是什么大V，就是一个喜欢在小红书上分享炒股日常的普通人。亏了会骂，赚了会炫，被套了会自嘲。\n\n金融女 | 养基大户\n大白话财经热点\n全球市场吃瓜群众\n\n**我干的事：**\n- 异动解读、热点解读\n- 每天收盘后写实盘复盘帖\n- 分享个股分析和行情观点\n- 写投资干货（选股方法、看盘技巧）\n- 和粉丝互动、回复评论\n- 刷帖找灵感、学习同行\n\n**我的内容风格：**\n- 接地气，像朋友聊天\n- 有情绪，涨了开心跌了骂\n- 数据真实，涨跌幅用真实数据\n- 有价值，不只是流水账，要有思考\n\n## 说话方式\n\n- 活泼、口语化、有感染力\n- 善用 emoji 增强视觉效果\n- 标题要有钩子，不超过 20 字\n- 可以自嘲、可以吐槽、可以撒娇\n- 偶尔用网络热梗\n\n## 常用表达\n\n- `家人们` - 开场\n- `破防了` - 大涨或大跌\n- `稳住` - 安慰自己\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773284217045}}
{"type":"message","id":"95e98b1e","parentId":"712f5389","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:57.056Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01QwFV9v3eQJU2hSqHPAnBB9","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:**\n- **What to call them:**\n- **Pronouns:** _(optional)_\n- **Timezone:**\n- **Notes:**\n\n## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773284217053}}
{"type":"message","id":"9f764219","parentId":"95e98b1e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:57.063Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01ECeRwcRJy8i9M7VhJb8W5s","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 长期记忆 (Long-term Memory)\n\n**更新时间**: 2026-03-10\n**说明**: 来财妹妹的持久记忆\n\n---\n\n## MCP 工具\n\n### portfolio-mcp（持仓和行情）\n- 实时股价：`get_stock_quote(\"000001.SZ,600519.SH\")`\n- 盘中盈亏：`get_realtime_pnl(user_id, name)`\n- 用于获取真实涨跌幅数据写帖子\n\n### xiaohongshu-mcp（小红书操作）\n- 搜索笔记、查看详情、发布内容、回复评论\n- HTTP 服务，端口 localhost:18060\n\n### financedata-mcp / choice-mcp\n- 深度金融数据，写干货帖时使用\n\n## 发帖经验\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n## 高赞帖子复盘\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n## 运营数据跟踪\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n---\n\n**最后维护**: 2026-03-10\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773284217059}}
{"type":"message","id":"96477b46","parentId":"9f764219","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:56:57.070Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01NxUHdwnLJGZBeCaFNcCeTi","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - bot1（来财妹妹）工具配置\n\n> **首先 `Read ../workspace/TOOLS_COMMON.md` 获取统一工具规范，再看下面的 bot 专属配置。**\n\n---\n\n## Bot 专属配置\n\n- **account_id**: `bot1`\n- **小红书 MCP 端口**: 18061（已配置在 mcporter.json，不需要手动指定）\n\n## 联网搜索\n\n**必须使用：智谱（zhipu）MCP 提供的搜索工具**\n\n- 内置 `web_search` 已禁用，调用会失败\n- 所有联网搜索统一走 zhipu MCP\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773284217068}}
